<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><title>Steam Curator 34646096-80-Days Reviews</title><link>https://store.steampowered.com/curator/34646096-80-Days/ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations/?query&amp;start=0&amp;count=10&amp;dynamic_data=&amp;sort=recent&amp;app_types=&amp;reset=false&amp;curations=&amp;tagids=</link><atom:link href="http://hub.slarker.me/steam/curator/34646096-80-Days" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>Steam Curator 34646096-80-Days Reviews - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 00:41:27 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>Raider Kid and the Ruby Chest</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/f947f476cbbeb0bc7be2177213fb0637d7f4e5ba/header_292x136.jpg?t=1777397449&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;螺哥推荐最新最in时尚单品，我立刻云了一分钟理解了一切：Spelunky既视感的类银魔。不只是因为这个妆造，更在于整体快节奏的趣味，不浪费你一点时间，包括无攻略搜隐藏物品也给配上了设计小巧思。再者是游玩经验有效带动正反馈，简单直白的角色能力，无神仙技能道具加持，不刷不肝。然后还有点睛的美术与趣味剧情。斯巴拉西，好评率没毛病。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/1085040/Raider_Kid_and_the_Ruby_Chest/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/1085040/Raider_Kid_and_the_Ruby_Chest/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/f947f476cbbeb0bc7be2177213fb0637d7f4e5ba/header_292x136.jpg?t=1777397449" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>Many Mini Typing Games</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/be5166979689dd3cd2eec2e9bd8b6e251e007ee1/header_292x136.jpg?t=1770641170&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;C哥严选墙裂推键，打字版瓦里奥制造。虽然属于只有50个小游戏（小段子）循环的小品体量，题材与形式却足够多样，其中与日常生活文本使用场景相关的部分尤为出彩，与纯粹神金的段子一样神金。少部分小游戏玩法可能休闲玩家不太熟悉但规则不难理解，比如猜单词、填字、Ghost Leg（梯子抽签）、国际象棋、古早文字ADV。有些笑点不太常见于中文社群但我相信家人们的因特网冲浪经验。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/2918930/Many_Mini_Typing_Games/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/2918930/Many_Mini_Typing_Games/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/be5166979689dd3cd2eec2e9bd8b6e251e007ee1/header_292x136.jpg?t=1770641170" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>Don&#39;t Sleep With The Fishes</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/5cef05a785a6b8d49dc588234aaf822dee7f47a0/header_292x136.jpg?t=1782468658&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;海难版60Seconds，有自己独特的趣味，有些许廉价轻度跳吓。因为故事设定的原因，在得知真结局之前的尝试在体验上不算连贯，甚至有点莫名其妙，碎片信息很难提前拼凑大图景。生存相关的数值、机制还有优化空间，另外3D化没能带来实质新玩点，比较遗憾，毕竟有了新的视觉呈现，仍然老套的交互就不够带劲了。总之开发者后续发挥值得关注。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/4834070/Dont_Sleep_With_The_Fishes/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/4834070/Dont_Sleep_With_The_Fishes/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/5cef05a785a6b8d49dc588234aaf822dee7f47a0/header_292x136.jpg?t=1782468658" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>Guns of Eschaton</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/d1506ed1c83ae8b6df13c5ea86f68f6a5ec04b2f/header_292x136.jpg?t=1785243780&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;维克多·安东诺夫（1973-2025），参与过的作品包括半条命2、耻辱、掠食。我看了机核Hyperspace大佬2019年文章《从17号城到顿沃城》很有趣，附上了链接。文中提到两点在这里推荐拓展查阅，一是维克多在Half Life 2 Raising The Bar一书中谈及不少创作细节，这本书不错；二是耻辱中顿沃城的创作，涉及对19世纪英国浪漫主义画家格里姆肖作品的借鉴，大师原作很妙。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/3734220/Guns_of_Eschaton/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/3734220/Guns_of_Eschaton/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/d1506ed1c83ae8b6df13c5ea86f68f6a5ec04b2f/header_292x136.jpg?t=1785243780" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>Meaningless Random Numbers</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211060/6cb4c77877dd287035d81e01d97d42bfd6d95f68/header_292x136.jpg?t=1781541360&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;如果说Q-UP还在认真赋予意义并给予引导，我觉得本作就更为的，“邪恶”：一切都不清不楚，但似乎又能理解一切并获得某种诡异的正反馈，于是不知不觉间就被引诱走远了。这种浸入虚妄、享受未知、不断试探、逐渐膨胀的感觉真是完美适用于这黑暗的调调。立绘要是换成更写实的风格就更妙了，目前还是不够神圣，堕落反差感戏剧性没能拉满。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/4211060/Meaningless_Random_Numbers/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/4211060/Meaningless_Random_Numbers/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211060/6cb4c77877dd287035d81e01d97d42bfd6d95f68/header_292x136.jpg?t=1781541360" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>Blessed Burden</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/f41247ebb4b6d1e38899f84f1bdcec831f6467c8/header_292x136.jpg?t=1780645913&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;2小时精巧跑酷小品，用角色性能强化升级来串起探索和速通的趣味，场景构建也给玩家留够了发挥空间，配合充足的复活点，利用游戏机制试探极限路线就很爽。美术也很棒棒，有Devil Daggers的味道，虽然贴图少了些过渡细节但整体气氛到位了——不难让人意识到，有时气氛并不仰赖全方位的营造，靠着亮眼巧思实现视觉张力也能带动沉浸，而配景、次要部分符合大调子即可。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/2379230/Blessed_Burden/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/2379230/Blessed_Burden/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/f41247ebb4b6d1e38899f84f1bdcec831f6467c8/header_292x136.jpg?t=1780645913" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>Techmino-Downstacking</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568800/ff280e85a6bcf2cceb30c75a87fcff231fab5ee0/header_292x136.jpg?t=1777199162&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;《俄罗斯挖块》，陀思妥耶夫斯基看了直摇头。顺带灌个水，沙俄19世纪大概往西伯利亚流放了100万人去开荒挖矿，绝大多数是违法犯罪分子，因为包括小偷小摸被抓的所以人很多，而政治犯只占1%。苏联时把这一传统做大做强，搞出“古拉格”也就是劳改营系统，专门流放劳改“人民的敌人”，大概涉及1500-3000万人。苏联笑话评论区常见的“送去西伯利亚挖土豆”来源就是这里。再顺带推荐一手播客“独树不成林”，很有趣。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/4568800/TechminoDownstacking/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/4568800/TechminoDownstacking/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568800/ff280e85a6bcf2cceb30c75a87fcff231fab5ee0/header_292x136.jpg?t=1777199162" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>FISH</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/865acdba97b457221f4732b6c18f3954f14f3699/header_292x136.jpg?t=1782271583&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;多么美好的夏夜，让我看看蒸蒸家人们在玩什么——家人：扮演石斑鱼旋转跳跃后用AK47把西瓜的假牙打出来。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/4312850/FISH/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/4312850/FISH/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/865acdba97b457221f4732b6c18f3954f14f3699/header_292x136.jpg?t=1782271583" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>Better Minesweeper</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898970/041545fe5afa8d0076c6a50b3a6a3cea24ca4147/header_292x136.jpg?t=1785017905&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;扫雷但better。因为Steam之前已经有了优秀的纸牌传人Free Solitaire（纸牌但free），所以去搜了一下Win弹球也就是“太空军校生”，这才意识到性质不太一样，而且版权涉及微软和EA两方，具体协议也不允许它独立于Win系统发布，蒸化无望了。另外顺势又查了查dos zone以及myabandonware两个眼熟网站的情况，理念、技术路线与运作，有趣但涉及版权灰色地带而且字符数超了所&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/3898970/Better_Minesweeper/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/3898970/Better_Minesweeper/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898970/041545fe5afa8d0076c6a50b3a6a3cea24ca4147/header_292x136.jpg?t=1785017905" medium="image"></media:content></item><item><title>walk</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563880/d7186f52ff41c641171bc2d936598ea8acc4db10/header_292x136.jpg?t=1784820374&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;新品节月更，看得眼花缭乱，择优推一手与Big Walk不同的情趣小walk作为印地代表。不知在这次开发过程中，Bilge有没有想起7年前硬憋《stikir》的那个夏天。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/4563880/walk/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://store.steampowered.com/app/4563880/walk/?snr=1_1056_ajaxgetfilteredrecommendations_1056_curator-tabs&amp;curator_clanid=34646096</guid><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563880/d7186f52ff41c641171bc2d936598ea8acc4db10/header_292x136.jpg?t=1784820374" medium="image"></media:content></item></channel></rss>